# Hosts the claude container may reach (extended regex, one per line).
# Anthropic API + auth/console, plus Rails docs for reference during
# planning. Everything else is denied.
^([a-z0-9-]+\.)*anthropic\.com$
^([a-z0-9-]+\.)*claude\.ai$
^([a-z0-9-]+\.)*claude\.com$
^(guides|api)\.rubyonrails\.org$
